16 0 obj
<< /A 48 0 R /Alt (Circular diagram illustrating diabetes treatment strategies, divided into sections: Non-hypoglycemic drugs, short-term insulin therapy, and non-insulin hypoglycemic drugs. It includes herbal and synthetic drugs affecting pathways like glucose metabolism, insulin secretion, and beta-cell function. Techniques such as pancreatic beta-cell remodeling, lipotoxicity and glucose toxicity management, and drug impacts on skeletal muscle cells, adipocytes, and hepatocytes are depicted with arrows and labels.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 28 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
17 0 obj
<< /A 49 0 R /Alt (Flowchart illustrating future research progress and clinical translation pathways for T2DM remission. It includes sections on mechanism exploration, developing predictive models, technology and drug innovation, and clinical systems construction. Key goals are individualized, sustainable, drug-free remission, reducing complications, and improving quality of life.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 34 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
